  rules: [
    "1\uFE0F\u20E3 UNREAL PAST NIMA?\n\nUnreal Past — hozirgi yoki o'tgan zamonda xayoliy vaziyatlarni ifodalash uchun ishlatiladigan grammatik tuzilma. B2 darajasida wish, if only, would rather, it's time kabi tuzilmalarni o'rganamiz.\n\n\uD83D\uDCCC WISH (xohish, afsus):\n  Present unreal: Wish + past simple\n    I wish I knew the answer. (I don't know it)\n  Past unreal: Wish + past perfect\n    I wish I had studied. (I didn't study)\n  Complaint: Wish + would\n    I wish you would stop smoking.\n\n\uD83D\uDCCC IF ONLY (xuddi wish, lekin kuchliroq):\n  If only I knew the answer!\n  If only I had studied harder!\n\n\uD83D\uDCCC WOULD RATHER (afzal ko'rish):\n  I'd rather you didn't go.\n  I'd rather you had told me.\n\n\uD83D\uDCCC IT'S TIME (vaqti keldi):\n  It's time we left.\n  It's about time you started working.",
    "2\uFE0F\u20E3 WISH + PAST SIMPLE — HOZIRGI XAYOL\n\nWish + past simple — hozirgi vaqtda haqiqatga to'g'ri kelmaydigan xohishlar:\n\n  I wish I knew the answer.\n    (Men javobni bilmayman, lekin bilishni xohlardim)\n\n  She wishes she lived in London.\n    (U Londonda yashamaydi, lekin yashashni xohlaydi)\n\n  I wish I were taller.\n    (Men baland emasman, lekin bo'lishni xohlardim)\n\n  They wish they had more money.\n    (Ularning ko'p pullari yo'q, lekin bo'lishini xohlardilar)\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 To be bilan always WERE (was EMAS):\n  I wish I WERE rich. (I wish I was rich norasmiy)\n  She wishes she WERE here.\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Past simple = hozirgi zamondagi xayol!\n  XATO: I wish I know → I wish I knew",
    "3\uFE0F\u20E3 WISH + PAST PERFECT — O'TGAN XAYOL\n\nWish + past perfect (had + V₃) — o'tmishda sodir bo'lgan yoki bo'lmagan narsaga afsus:\n\n  I wish I had studied harder for the exam.\n    (Men o'qimaganman, lekin o'qigan bo'lishni xohlardim)\n\n  She wishes she had taken the job.\n    (U ishni qabul qilmagan, hozir afsusda)\n\n  We wish we had booked earlier.\n    (Oldin bron qilmaganmiz, hozir afsusdamiz)\n\n  He wishes he hadn't said that.\n    (U buni aytdi va hozir afsusda)\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Past perfect = o'tgan zamondagi xayol!\n\uD83D\uDD34 Had = have emas, past perfect!\n  XATO: I wish I have studied → I wish I had studied",
    "4\uFE0F\u20E3 WISH + WOULD — SHIKOYAT\n\nWish + would + verb — biror kishining xatti-harakatidan norozilik yoki o'zgarishni xohlash:\n\n  I wish you would stop making noise.\n    (Sen shovqin qilishni to'xtatishingni xohlardim)\n\n  I wish it would stop raining.\n    (Yomg'ir to'xtashini xohlardim)\n\n  She wishes her neighbours would be quieter.\n    (Qo'shnilari jim bo'lishini xohlardi)\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Wish + would faqat boshqa odam yoki narsa bilan:\n  I wish I would... → NO! (o'zing haqingda emas)\n  TO'G'RI: I wish I could... (o'zing uchun)\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Wish + would = o'zgarishni xohlash, norozilik\n  XATO: I wish I would be taller → I wish I were taller\n  XATO: I wish I would know → I wish I knew",
    "5\uFE0F\u20E3 IF ONLY\n\nIf only — wish bilan bir xil, lekin kuchliroq his-tuyg'u (afsus, xohish):\n\n  Present:\n    If only I knew the answer!\n    If only I were rich!\n\n  Past:\n    If only I had studied harder!\n    If only I hadn't said that!\n\n  Complaint:\n    If only you would listen to me!\n    If only it would stop raining!\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 If only = I wish + kuchli hissiyot\n  If only I had known! (Qaniydi bilsam edi!)\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 If only mustaqil gap yoki bosh gap bilan:\n  If only I had known, I would have helped.\n  If only she were here!",
    "6\uFE0F\u20E3 WOULD RATHER VA IT'S TIME\n\nWOULD RATHER (I'd rather) — afzal ko'rish:\n\n  Bir xil subject:\n    I'd rather stay home. (hozirgi/kelasi)\n    I'd rather have stayed home. (o'tgan)\n\n  Turli subject:\n    I'd rather you stayed home.\n    I'd rather you had stayed home. (o'tgan)\n\nIT'S TIME — biror narsa qilish vaqti keldi:\n  It's time to go. (infinitive)\n  It's time we went. (past subjunctive)\n  It's about time you started working. (kuchliroq)\n  It's high time we left. (juda kuchli)\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 It's time + past = hozirgi vaqt haqida!\n  It's time we left. = We should leave now.\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Would rather + past = hozirgi/kelasi haqida!\n  I'd rather you didn't go. = I don't want you to go.",
    "7\uFE0F\u20E3 O'ZBEKCHA XATOLAR\n\n\u2022 I wish I was → I wish I were (to be bilan were)\n\u2022 I wish I know → I wish I knew (past for present)\n\u2022 I wish I have studied → I wish I had studied\n\u2022 I wish I would be taller → I wish I were taller\n\u2022 It's time we go → It's time we went (past)\n\u2022 I'd rather you go → I'd rather you went (past)\n\u2022 If only I know → If only I knew\n\u2022 I wish I can → I wish I could\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Esda tuting: Unreal Past = past tense = xayoliy vaziyat!",
  ],
