  rules: [
    "1️⃣ COMPLEX PREPOSITIONS NIMA?\n\nComplex prepositions (murakkab predloglar) — ikki yoki undan ortiq so'zdan tashkil topgan predloglar. B2 darajasida rasmiy va akademik matnlarda ko'p ishlatiladi.\n\n📌 Eng muhim complex prepositions:\n  • in spite of / despite = qaramay\n  • by means of = yordamida, orqali\n  • in terms of = nuqtai nazaridan\n  • with regard to / regarding = ga nisbatan, haqida\n  • on behalf of = nomidan\n  • in the event of = vaziyatda, holda\n  • due to / owing to = sababli\n  • in addition to = qo'shimcha ravishda\n  • in case of = agar... bo'lsa",
    "2️⃣ IN SPITE OF / DESPITE — QARAMAY\n\nIn spite of / Despite — biror narsaga qaramasdan, zidlikni ifodalash:\n\n  In spite of + noun / gerund / the fact that\n    In spite of the rain, we went for a walk.\n    (Yomg'irga qaramay, sayrga chiqdik)\n\n  Despite + noun / gerund / the fact that\n    Despite being tired, she continued working.\n    (Charchaganiga qaramay, ishlashni davom ettirdi)\n\n📌 MUHIM FARQLAR:\n  Despite = in spite of (bir xil ma'no)\n  Despite + noun (without 'of')\n  In spite of + noun (with 'of')\n  Despite / in spite of + the fact that + clause\n\n  XATO: Despite of the rain ❌\n  TO'G'RI: Despite the rain ✅ / In spite of the rain ✅",
    "3️⃣ BY MEANS OF / BY WAY OF — VOSITA\n\nBy means of = yordamida, orqali (vosita va usul):\n\n  Information is transmitted by means of signals.\n    (Ma'lumot signallar orqali uzatiladi)\n\n  By way of = orqali, yo'l bilan\n    He entered by way of the back door.\n    (U orqa eshik orqali kirdi)\n\n📌 By means of vs By:\n  By = oddiy vosita: by car, by email\n  By means of = rasmiy vosita: by means of negotiation\n\n📌 Rasmiy matnlarda 'by means of' ko'p ishlatiladi:\n  The problem was solved by means of computer simulation.",
    "4️⃣ IN TERMS OF / WITH REGARD TO — NUQTAI NAZAR\n\nIn terms of = nuqtai nazaridan, jihatidan:\n  In terms of quality, this product is excellent.\n    (Sifat nuqtai nazaridan, bu mahsulot a'lo)\n\n  The project is successful in terms of outcomes.\n    (Loyiha natijalar jihatidan muvaffaqiyatli)\n\nWith regard to / Regarding = ga nisbatan, haqida:\n  With regard to your question, I will respond later.\n    (Sizning savolingizga kelsak, keyinroq javob beraman)\n\n  Regarding the meeting, it has been postponed.\n    (Yig'ilish haqida — u qoldirildi)\n\n📌 With regard to = Regarding (bir xil ma'no, regarding qisqaroq)\n  XATO: With regards to ❌ (regards emas, regard)\n  TO'G'RI: With regard to ✅",
    "5️⃣ ON BEHALF OF / IN THE EVENT OF\n\nOn behalf of = nomidan (vakillik):\n  I am writing on behalf of my company.\n    (Men kompaniyam nomidan yozyapman)\n\n  She accepted the award on behalf of the team.\n    (U mukofotni jamoa nomidan qabul qildi)\n\nIn the event of = ...bo'lgan taqdirda (rasmiy):\n  In the event of fire, leave the building immediately.\n    (Yong'in sodir bo'lgan taqdirda, binoni darhol tark eting)\n\n  In the event of rain, the ceremony will be indoors.\n    (Yomg'ir yog'sa, marosim bino ichida bo'ladi)\n\n📌 In the event of + noun\n📌 In the event that + clause\n  In the event that you are late, call me.",
    "6️⃣ DUE TO / OWING TO / IN ADDITION TO / IN CASE OF\n\nDue to = sababli (sabab):\n  The flight was cancelled due to bad weather.\n    (Ob-havo yomonligi sababli reys bekor qilindi)\n\nOwing to = sababli (rasmiyroq):\n  Owing to unforeseen circumstances, the event is off.\n    (Kutilmagan holatlar sababli tadbir bekor qilindi)\n\nIn addition to = qo'shimcha ravishda:\n  In addition to English, she speaks French.\n    (Ingliz tilidan tashqari, u fransuz tilida ham gapiradi)\n\nIn case of = agar... bo'lsa:\n  In case of emergency, break the glass.\n    (Favqulodda vaziyatda, shishani sindiring)\n\n📌 Due to vs Owing to: bir xil ma'no, owing to rasmiyroq.\n  Due to + noun (because of + noun)",
    "7️⃣ O'ZBEKCHA XATOLAR\n\n• Despite of → despite (of kerak emas)\n  XATO: Despite of the rain ❌\n  TO'G'RI: Despite the rain ✅\n  In spite of the rain ✅\n\n• With regards to → with regard to (regard yakkalikda)\n  XATO: With regards to your email ❌\n  TO'G'RI: With regard to your email ✅\n\n• In terms of ni noto'g'ri joylashtirish:\n  XATO: In terms of, it is cheap ❌ (noun kerak)\n  TO'G'RI: In terms of cost, it is cheap ✅\n\n• On behalf of ni 'o'rniga' ma'nosida ishlatish:\n  TO'G'RI: on behalf of the company (nomidan)\n  XATO: on behalf of the book (o'rniga) → instead of\n\n• In the event of + verb:\n  XATO: In the event of it rains ❌\n  TO'G'RI: In the event of rain ✅\n  TO'G'RI: In the event that it rains ✅",
  ],
